<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17555" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">faecŭlentus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj.
		faex, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>abounding in dregs</i> or <i>sediment</i>, <i>thick</i>, <i>impure</i>, <i>feculent</i> (post-Aug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vinum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					2, 2, 20</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cels. 5, 26, 19</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sardonyches,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					37, 6, 23, § 89</span></i>
			.—<i>Comp.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">superficies,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sol. 33</span></i>
			.—<i>Sup.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quorum aliud faeculentissimum redditur terrae,</span>”
				i. e. <i>excrement</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Aug. de Vera Relig. 40</span></i>
			.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hilaritas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Arn. 3, 119</span></i>
			.</div>
